        Tents, <span class="text-emerald-300 drop-shadow-[0_2px_10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)]">Tensile Shade Structures</span> & <span class="text-amber-300 drop-shadow-[0_2px_10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)]">Steel Fabrication</span>
